  "body": "Discover the versatility and space of this beautifully designed home in the sought-after Long Bay area. Offering 4 bedrooms plus a versatile office space with the potential to be used as an additional bedroom, offering flexibility for growing families or guests, or those working from home.\r\n\r\n* Ground floor: Separate office/multipurpose room + lounge + bathroom, with its own access - a fantastic flexible space for work from home, teenagers, extended family or guests. Double garaging with internal access.\r\n\r\n* First floor: Open-plan kitchen, dining and family living flowing seamlessly to the outdoor deck, plus a separate living room opening onto the balcony. There is one master bedroom with its own ensuite on this level, as well as a guest toilet.\r\n\r\n* Second floor: 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms including another master ensuite, plus an additional study/living area.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in sought-after Long Bay, you'll be just minutes from Long Bay Beach, Ashley Reserve, Long Bay College, Long Bay Primary School, New World, local cafes, and public transport. With a sunny north-facing aspect and outstanding versatility, this is a home designed to adapt to your family's changing needs. \r\n\r\nContact Fiona at 021 0292 9309 or Iris at 027 2797 990 to arrange a viewing now!",
